{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.ZigZag","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.SmallHbar","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZFunctorial","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZHexagonCentral","lean:module:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ"],"declarations":39,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zigzag_identities","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zigzag_identities","kind":"theorem","line":363,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L363-L380","doc":"**The corrected duality data satisfy both zigzag identities** (`|ℏ| ≤ 1/12`). With\n`ν = zig(Φ)₀₀ ≠ 0` and `ε' = ν⁻¹ ε`:\n`(1 ⊗ ε') Φ (η ⊗ 1) = 1_V` and `(ε' ⊗ 1) Φ⁻¹ (1 ⊗ η) = 1_V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag_eq_zig","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag_eq_zig","kind":"theorem","line":354,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L354-L361","doc":"**The second zigzag equals the first**: `(ε ⊗ 1) Φ⁻¹ (1 ⊗ η) = (1 ⊗ ε) Φ (η ⊗ 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.P_E2'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.P_E2'","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L344-L352","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1'_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1'_P","kind":"theorem","line":334,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L334-L342","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L326-L332","doc":"Conjugation by `P₁₃` exchanges `Φ(A, B)` and `Φ(B, A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_B","kind":"theorem","line":320,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L320-L324","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13_A","kind":"theorem","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L314-L318","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.continuous_conj13","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.continuous_conj13","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L311-L312","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.conj13","kind":"def","line":295,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L295-L309","doc":"Conjugation by the flip `P₁₃` of the outer legs, as a `ℂ`-algebra map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":282,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L282-L293","doc":"**The zigzag scalar is nonzero for `|ℏ| ≤ 1/12`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_scalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_scalar","kind":"theorem","line":274,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L274-L280","doc":"**The first zigzag is a scalar**: `zig(Φ) = ν · 1`, `ν = zig(Φ)₀₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assoc_mul_assocInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assoc_mul_assocInv","kind":"theorem","line":270,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L270-L272","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assocInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assocInv","kind":"def","line":265,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L265-L268","doc":"Its inverse `Φ(ℏ P₂₃, ℏ P₁₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.assoc","kind":"def","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L260-L263","doc":"The associator `Φ = Φ_KZ(ℏ P₁₂, ℏ P₂₃)` of `D_ℏ` on `V^{⊗3}`, `V = ℂ²`, for `|ℏ| < 1/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.nonResonant_smul_P_small","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.nonResonant_smul_P_small","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L255-L258","doc":"The residues are non-resonant for `|ℏ| < 1/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_smul_P_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_smul_P_le","kind":"theorem","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L251-L253","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_zig_sub_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_zig_sub_le","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L227-L238","doc":"`‖zig M − zig 1‖ ≤ 2 ‖M − 1‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_E2_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_E2_le","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L218-L225","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_E1_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_E1_le","kind":"theorem","line":210,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L210-L216","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.nonResonant_of_norm_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.nonResonant_of_norm_lt","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L182-L208","doc":"**Small residues are non-resonant.** If `2‖A‖ < 1` then every `k − ad_A` (`k ≥ 1`) is\nbijective: injective by the norm estimate, surjective by finite dimension. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_permP_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.norm_permP_le","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L169-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.eq_smul_one_of_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.eq_smul_one_of_commute","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L149-L160","doc":"A `2 × 2` matrix commuting with both unipotent generators of `SL₂` is scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_mul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_mul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L136-L147","doc":"If `M` commutes with `g^{⊗3}` and `det g = 1`, then `zig M` commutes with `g`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.G3_E2'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.G3_E2'","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L126-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1_G3'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1_G3'","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L116-L124","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.commute_permP_G3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.commute_permP_G3","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L99-L114","doc":"`g^{⊗3}` commutes with every permutation of the tensor legs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.G3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.G3","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L95-L97","doc":"`g^{⊗3}` on `V^{⊗3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag_one","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L87-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig_one","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L81-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zag","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L78-L79","doc":"The second zigzag `(ε ⊗ 1) ∘ M ∘ (1 ⊗ η)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.zig","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L76-L77","doc":"The first zigzag `(1 ⊗ ε) ∘ M ∘ (η ⊗ 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E2'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E2'","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L73-L74","doc":"`1 ⊗ η : V → V^{⊗3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1'","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L71-L72","doc":"`ε ⊗ 1 : V^{⊗3} → V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E2","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L69-L70","doc":"`η ⊗ 1 : V → V^{⊗3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.E1","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L67-L68","doc":"`1 ⊗ ε : V^{⊗3} → V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.eps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.eps","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L64-L65","doc":"`ε`, as a matrix of coefficients: `ε(e₀ ⊗ e₁) = 1`, `ε(e₁ ⊗ e₀) = −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.forall3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.forall3","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L56-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.sum3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.sum3","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L50-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.ZigZag.e3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.ZigZag.e3","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/ZigZag.lean#L43-L48","doc":"`Fin 2 × Fin 2 × Fin 2 ≃ (Fin 3 → Fin 2)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}